nd Atlas","/farmland-atlas/south-dakota/walworth-county"],["ARC or PLC in Walworth County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/walworth-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows October to November under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. On that middle, 2026 so far has run 64% for January to February and 79% for June to July. Back in 2025, September to October came in at 214% on the middle. Grid 30122 had its driest year in 1976 at 44%.</p>"}
